    "# Exercise 2 – k-NN classifier on Iris\n"
    "\n",
    "**Task:** Implement a k-NN classifier for the Iris dataset. Split the data randomly 70 % / 30 %, compare k = 3, 7 and 11 over 30 random splits (boxplot), and show the confusion matrix and metrics of one test per k. Finally, explain why k should be odd for two classes.\n",
